WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Meet AgriTrace, traceability-as-a-service for PNG agriculture — one record from farmer to buyer.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Register your cooperative and choose a plan that scales with your farmers.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Track farmers, plots, harvest batches, and shipments from a live dashboard.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Follow every lot through the chain of custody, from farm gate to export.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Monitor cold storage and give buyers a restricted portal view.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
AgriTrace. Developed and powered by Deeps Systems.
